% The dimensions of Target_ghost3 are set to the VEHICLE-Preset: [Width: 1.83 m, Length: 4.65 m, PivotPoint: -3.5 m].
% The dimensions of Target_ghost4 are set to the VEHICLE-Preset: [Width: 1.83 m, Length: 4.65 m, PivotPoint: -3.5 m].
% The dimensions of Target_ghost5 are set to the VEHICLE-Preset: [Width: 1.83 m, Length: 4.65 m, PivotPoint: -3.5 m].
% The dimensions of Target_ghost6 are set to the VEHICLE-Preset: [Width: 1.83 m, Length: 4.65 m, PivotPoint: -3.5 m].
% The initial conditions of Ego are set to: [Start-Speed: 0 kph, Start-Heading: 0 deg].
% The initial conditions of Target are set to: [Start-Speed: 50 kph, Start-Heading: 90 deg].
% The initial conditions of Target_ghost are set to: [Start-Speed: 60 kph, Start-Heading: 30 deg].
% The initial conditions of Target_ghost2 are set to: [Start-Speed: 60 kph, Start-Heading: -30 deg].
% The initial conditions of Target2 are set to: [Start-Speed: 50 kph, Start-Heading: 180 deg].
% The initial conditions of Target_ghost3 are set to: [Start-Speed: 60 kph, Start-Heading: 90 deg].
% The initial conditions of Target_ghost4 are set to: [Start-Speed: 60 kph, Start-Heading: -90 deg].
% The initial conditions of Target_ghost5 are set to: [Start-Speed: 60 kph, Start-Heading: 150 deg].
% The initial conditions of Target_ghost6 are set to: [Start-Speed: 60 kph, Start-Heading: -150 deg].
% The start position of Target is shifted by Lateral-Offset: 15 m, Longitudinal-Offset: -30 m.
% The start position of Target_ghost is shifted by Lateral-Offset: 2 m, Longitudinal-Offset: -18 m.
% The start position of Target_ghost2 is shifted by Lateral-Offset: 1 m, Longitudinal-Offset: -20 m.
% The start position of Target2 is shifted by Lateral-Offset: 15 m, Longitudinal-Offset: -30 m.
