% The start position of Target_ghost5 is shifted by Lateral-Offset: 2 m, Longitudinal-Offset: 15 m.
% The start position of Target_ghost6 is shifted by Lateral-Offset: 6 m, Longitudinal-Offset: 20 m.
% Add a stationary section to Ego with: Duration: 6 s, Tracker-data( Track-Status: MATURE ).
% Add a straight section to Target with: End-Speed: 50 kph, Distance: 70 m, Precision: 1, Tracker-data( Track-Status: MATURE ).
% Add a stationary section to Target_ghost with: Duration: 3.8 s, Tracker-data( Track-Status: MATURE ).
% Add a straight section to Target_ghost with: End-Speed: 60 kph, Distance: 5 m, Precision: 1, Tracker-data( Track-Status: MATURE ).
% Add a stationary section to Target_ghost2 with: Duration: 3.8 s, Tracker-data( Track-Status: MATURE ).
% Add a straight section to Target_ghost2 with: End-Speed: 60 kph, Distance: 5 m, Precision: 1, Tracker-data( Track-Status: MATURE ).
% Add a straight section to Target2 with: End-Speed: 50 kph, Distance: 70 m, Precision: 1, Tracker-data( Track-Status: MATURE ).
% Add a stationary section to Target_ghost3 with: Duration: 3.8 s, Tracker-data( Track-Status: MATURE ).
% Add a straight section to Target_ghost3 with: End-Speed: 60 kph, Distance: 5 m, Precision: 1, Tracker-data( Track-Status: MATURE ).
% Add a stationary section to Target_ghost4 with: Duration: 3.8 s, Tracker-data( Track-Status: MATURE ).
